{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-p54p-jq4x-rc28","cve_id":"CVE-2026-103433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/buildx/security-advisories/GHSA-p54p-jq4x-rc28","html_url":"https://github.com/docker/buildx/security/advisories/GHSA-p54p-jq4x-rc28","summary":"Bake filesystem entitlement consent is skipped for certain secret and oci-layout definitions","description":"### Impact\r\nIn certain conditions, an untrusted Bake definition may expose files accessible to the Buildx client without the expected `fs.read` approval. The affected definitions involve access to pathless build secrets or build contexts from local OCI layouts. Users who run untrusted Bake definitions are affected.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\nIssue has been fixed in version v0.37.2.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nRun only trusted Bake definitions until upgrading. Check that Bake definitions you are building do not contain suspicious build secrets or OCI layout definitions.\r\n \r\n### Credits\r\n\r\nThis issue was reported by Artem Lytkin.\r\n\r\n### References\r\n_Are there any links users can visit to find out more?_\r\n","severity":"medium","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"tonistiigi","id":585223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NTIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/585223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi","html_url":"https://github.com/tonistiigi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonistiigi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonist